BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
DTSTART:20261028T224500Z
DTEND:20261029T015500Z
DTSTAMP:20261028T224500Z
UID:IVMgQn2By1
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 174 mins (2h54m)\n\nThirty-four days before she’s 
 sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites
  a skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intim
 ate portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journ
 ey into the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lanc
 e Oppenheim comes You Can See Everything.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/i
 n-theaters/you-can-see-everything\n\nEstimated start: 16:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
