DTSTART:20261029T020000Z
DTEND:20261029T041000Z
DTSTAMP:20261029T020000Z
UID:9DhXobTwDt
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nScarecrowberSan Francisco Health
  Inspector Matthew Bennell (Donald Sutherland) investigates unsettling cha
 nges in the people around him\, uncovering a terrifying truth spreading th
 roughout the city in Philip Kaufman’s gripping sci-fi chiller. To be in
 troduced by Malakie Peters from Scarecrow Video.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/p
 rograms-and-events/scarecrowber-2026/invasion-of-the-body-snatchers\n\nEst
 imated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
