BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NAZA
DTSTART:20261022T230000Z
DTEND:20261023T003500Z
DTSTAMP:20261022T230000Z
UID:vZqvLmf8qs
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 80 mins (1h20m)\n\nDirected by Yuval Abraham and Rac
 hel Szor\, two of the co-directors of the 2024 Oscar-winning documentary N
 o Other Land\, NAZA reveals the systems behind Israel’s bombing of Gaza 
 and its mass killing of Palestinian civilians. Winner of Special Jury Priz
 e at the 2026 Venice Film Festival.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/naza\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:KEN RUSSELL’S THE DEVILS (1971)
DTSTART:20261022T233000Z
DTEND:20261023T014000Z
DTSTAMP:20261022T233000Z
UID:Kgcjx2YI5y
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 114 mins (1h54m)\n\nAn enduring masterpiece of cinem
 a starring Oliver Reed and Vanessa Redgrave\, KEN RUSSELL’S THE DEVILS i
 s a prescient epic of obsession and corruption –and a defining work of a
 rt from seminal filmmaker Ken Russell. KEN RUSSELL’S THE DEVILS is the u
 ncut and unfiltered theatrical experience that Russell always envisioned 
 – and the first time the film will be presented restored and in 4K.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ken-russells-the-devils\n\nEstimate
 d start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
