DTSTART:20261026T011500Z
DTEND:20261026T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20261026T011500Z
UID:sbTSJJyWEw
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nThe Seattle Polish Film Festiva
 l presents the film Wild\, Wild East. Wolff\, a mysterious official fr
 om Berlin\, arrives in a sleepy small town in eastern Poland. He carefully
  guards the reasons for his visit\, but his mere presence quickly distur
 bs the peace in Małe Zalesie.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theater
 s/seattle-polish-film-festival-2026/wild-wild-east\n\nEstimated start: 18:
 30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
