SUMMARY:Heel
DTSTART:20261024T224500Z
DTEND:20261025T005000Z
DTSTAMP:20261024T224500Z
UID:K3R0I9ZCOJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nThe Seattle Polish Film Festival
  presents the film Heel. The story follows nineteen-year-old criminal Tomm
 y\, who is kidnapped and forced into resocialization by a dysfunctional co
 uple\, Chris and Kathryn. They try to turn him into a "good boy\," while T
