DTEND:20261030T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T020000Z
UID:tuSLgkjmTR
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nHaving swapped passports and ide
 ntities with a deceased acquaintance\, disaffected journalist David Locke 
 (Jack Nicholson) discovers that the life he traded in for has connections 
 to secret proxy wars and the international arms trade.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/programs-and-events/the-open-road/the-passenger\n\nEstimated start: 1
 9:15
