DESCRIPTION:Duration: 135 mins (2h15m)\n\nWar reduced Japan to zero\, and 
 Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then\, and the
  country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally rec
 laim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace
 \, a new threat strikes\, crushing hope in an instant.There is no third t
 ime. Everything ends here.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/godz
 illa-minus-zero\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
