DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nNouvelles FemmesA husband (Jean-
 Paul Belmondo) flees his shallow Paris life with the babysitter (Anna Kari
 na)\, to French Riviera escapades with gangsters\, stolen loot\, sunny hed
 onism\, political commentary\; a charming disorder\, a reflection of direc
 tor Godard's and Karina’s stormy marriage. It’s truly moving when he h
 as her gaze into our/his camera’s eyes.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs
 -and-events/nouvelles-femmes/pierrot-le-fou\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
