 road in search of the world's greatest\, and most reclusive\, guitar maker
  in this cult rock ‘n’ roll odyssey. Co-directed by photographer Rober
 t Frank and Two-Lane Blacktop screenwriter Rudolph Wurlitzer.\n\nhttps://w
 ww.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-open-road/candy-mountain\n\nEstimated 
 start: 19:15
