UID:7VHkBe1CUM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nSeattle Film Critics Society PNW 
 Awards 2026Aberdeen-raised director Mia Moore’s debut film\, executive p
 roduced by Lilly Wachowski\, is a heady\, romantic sci-fi starring a trans
  woman who enters a new day after ten years stuck in “the loop.” Filmm
 aker Mia Moore Marchant scheduled to attend\, with a post-film Q&A modera
 ted by Sara Michelle Fetters (Moviefreak\, Seattle Gay News).\n\nhttps://w
 ww.siff.net/programs-and-events/seattle-film-critics-society-pnw-awards-20
 26/again-again\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
